{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Smoke, all of it.</b> That is, the fire overpowered the very body of the mountain, and its stones were burned as is the manner of the kiln in which stones are burned to make lime, and from now on the stones of Sinai became lime. And the verse's saying <b>and all the mountain trembled greatly</b> — for such is the way of stones when fire overpowers them in the kiln: they shake and emit a sound of trembling."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:30:10.452627089Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}